Z||000002||vietnow||12-02-2000||05:09 PM||||being a celica owner, we get all kinds of ****  from every car owner out there.<P>apparently everyone thinks the celica is the joke of all sports cars.<P>well, of course, i have a different opinion....<P>but everyone i have met on a celica board has been open to all other cars (other than the infamous riceboy cars)<P><BR>Some people are not as open minded as you know, I might not like a car, but i dont bash their owners because of it.  <P>The one Honda i can respect is the prelude.  after owning a 1980 prelude base model, i tell you, that car is a real racer.  the steering and suspension, even on the old rust bucket, was nice, and that thing could pull turns so tight it would scare you.  the engine was bogging down bad, and it had oil leaks all in the engine. it smoked (all the time) real bad! tho, and i had to junk it<BR>, i still love that car and would love to have another one..   <P><BR>so the moral of the the story is, dont bash and flame a car, until you have owned one.<P> peace out<P>oh yeah, i will be getting pics of the celica up soon... as soon as i can get the film developed.<P><BR>------------------<BR>Vietnow --<BR>1986 Celica GTS<BR><p>[This message has been edited by vietnow (edited 12-02-2000).]||||reg||1
